    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2038. As terrorism becomes the world's greatest threat, governments prove ineffective. At the Global Council, Creed announces the creation of an independent organization named Liberty Force to combat terrorism. Liberty Force quickly grows stronger and carries out successful operations. However, to be more effective in the fight against terrorism, Creed forms an elite team called V.O.L.T (Vigilante Operation Lightning Team) made up of his best soldiers. V.O.L.T will now be humanity's greatest weapon against terrorism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/07021f14c6bfec575e1d81d38273ae9d.poster.avif?t=1751616472\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/07021f14c6bfec575e1d81d38273ae9d.webm?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/07021f14c6bfec575e1d81d38273ae9d.mp4?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V.O.L.T launches with two major multiplayer game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquest:</strong> A mode where two large teams compete to capture and hold specific areas on a massive battlefield. In addition to the 120 vs 120 massive mode, where you can battle using tanks, helicopters, jets, and ground vehicles, there are also smaller maps featuring 60 vs 60 and 30 vs 30 player modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch:</strong> Compete solo against other players and fight to kill. Show your combat skills without using character abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER V.O.L.T'S ELITE CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from specialists with unique active and passive abilities within different classes that define your role in battle, and make the war even more epic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/bebc713580c700416e4f31696a508043.poster.avif?t=1751616472\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/bebc713580c700416e4f31696a508043.webm?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/bebc713580c700416e4f31696a508043.mp4?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual effort alone won't be enough in battle; you need teammates who will watch your back and cooperate with you. Fight alongside your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/2eca46dd7323686c511eb1370084177e.poster.avif?t=1751616472\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/2eca46dd7323686c511eb1370084177e.webm?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/2eca46dd7323686c511eb1370084177e.mp4?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR COMBAT STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your attachments and customize your weapons to match your combat style. Save your customized loadouts and express your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/12b1af6f3475fd08a588967374098695.poster.avif?t=1751616472\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/12b1af6f3475fd08a588967374098695.webm?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/12b1af6f3475fd08a588967374098695.mp4?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTROY ENEMIES WITH WAR MACHINES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks that bring chaos to the battlefield, helicopters soaring like vultures, death-dealing jets from the skies, and more destruction await you. Feel the impact of battle with destructible buildings and structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/16281e265f278b39dbb49adcd9031365.poster.avif?t=1751616472\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/16281e265f278b39dbb49adcd9031365.webm?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/16281e265f278b39dbb49adcd9031365.mp4?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2038. As terrorism becomes the world's greatest threat, governments prove ineffective. At the Global Council, Creed announces the creation of an independent organization named Liberty Force to combat terrorism. Liberty Force quickly grows stronger and carries out successful operations. However, to be more effective in the fight against terrorism, Creed forms an elite team called V.O.L.T (Vigilante Operation Lightning Team) made up of his best soldiers. V.O.L.T will now be humanity's greatest weapon against terrorism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/07021f14c6bfec575e1d81d38273ae9d.poster.avif?t=1751616472\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/07021f14c6bfec575e1d81d38273ae9d.webm?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/07021f14c6bfec575e1d81d38273ae9d.mp4?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V.O.L.T launches with two major multiplayer game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquest:</strong> A mode where two large teams compete to capture and hold specific areas on a massive battlefield. In addition to the 120 vs 120 massive mode, where you can battle using tanks, helicopters, jets, and ground vehicles, there are also smaller maps featuring 60 vs 60 and 30 vs 30 player modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch:</strong> Compete solo against other players and fight to kill. Show your combat skills without using character abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER V.O.L.T'S ELITE CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from specialists with unique active and passive abilities within different classes that define your role in battle, and make the war even more epic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/bebc713580c700416e4f31696a508043.poster.avif?t=1751616472\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/bebc713580c700416e4f31696a508043.webm?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/bebc713580c700416e4f31696a508043.mp4?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual effort alone won't be enough in battle; you need teammates who will watch your back and cooperate with you. Fight alongside your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/2eca46dd7323686c511eb1370084177e.poster.avif?t=1751616472\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/2eca46dd7323686c511eb1370084177e.webm?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/2eca46dd7323686c511eb1370084177e.mp4?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR COMBAT STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your attachments and customize your weapons to match your combat style. Save your customized loadouts and express your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/12b1af6f3475fd08a588967374098695.poster.avif?t=1751616472\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/12b1af6f3475fd08a588967374098695.webm?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/12b1af6f3475fd08a588967374098695.mp4?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTROY ENEMIES WITH WAR MACHINES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks that bring chaos to the battlefield, helicopters soaring like vultures, death-dealing jets from the skies, and more destruction await you. Feel the impact of battle with destructible buildings and structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/16281e265f278b39dbb49adcd9031365.poster.avif?t=1751616472\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/16281e265f278b39dbb49adcd9031365.webm?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413390/extras/16281e265f278b39dbb49adcd9031365.mp4?t=1751616472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
